WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:04,530
Go to the place and explain the work remuneration clearly. I have the right to refuse.

2
00:00:04,530 --> 00:00:06,330
If you refuse, I'll send you back to make a deal.

3
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:14,170
you are alone on the island

4
00:00:14,170 --> 00:00:16,170
You’ve already lived like this. Don’t visit.

5
00:00:16,170 --> 00:00:17,370
your job is there

6
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:19,280
you let me

7
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:20,880
Clean chicken manure

8
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:22,480
I can cut up bamboo to find food

9
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,480
Why is it this?

10
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:24,880
Because this is what I'm missing now

11
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:28,080
If you are deliberately insulting me, then don't cover it up.

12
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:29,080
I'll take you back

13
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:30,680
you come to me

14
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:31,880
It's exchanging labor for fire

15
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:32,880
Not here to choose a position

16
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:34,480
The work itself is not high or low

17
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:36,480
Only if you are willing to be with me outside

18
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:37,680
Never done such a thing

19
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:39,080
Your company doesn't exist here either

20
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:40,680
Assistant and best actress trophies

21
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:42,480
What kind of movie queen boss are you outside?

22
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:43,680
It has nothing to do with this roll

23
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:45,080
Of course you can continue to be arrogant

24
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:46,880
But your arrogance is useless

25
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:51,300
I can't light the fire tonight. I haven't decided yet.

26
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:52,300
I asked about tools
